## EXAMPLE ADR STRUCTURE

```markdown
# ADR 001: {Decision Title}

## Status
Accepted

## Context
{Issue motivating this decision}

## Decision
{The change we are making}

## Consequences
### Positive
- ...
### Negative
- ...
### Neutral
- ...

## Alternatives Considered
### {Alt}: {Name}
Pros / Cons / Rejected because

## References
- ...
```

